Subject: [PATCH candidate] host: publish no-GL readback only after reader success

Against sealed D9 gfxstream tree ea665af11444f3a33c10d22896fa27e53b862a62.
Preserve IColorBuffer's void API and add a checked ColorBuffer entry that propagates
existing GL/Vulkan bool results. Zero-initialize the cache; stage no-GL reads in a
per-display scratch buffer allocated once at callback registration and reused under
the cache lock. Only publish on reader success, preserving the last good frame on
explicit failure. No GPU run or build has been performed for this candidate.

